食，獨若不聞。」鑒曰：「正此佳婿邪！」訪之，乃羲之也，遂以女妻之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"first_line":14,"last_line":14,"revision_id":2603570,"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/jin080-wangxizhi-comparison/projection.json","raw_file_sha256":"4f3f42dd7d8ab0ca3c45e6524e4977db40332e845080367088be0419a3a0e8a0","unit_key":"p001","source_layer":"received_chapter"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"王羲之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDCA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整所選數位比較傳文與此處角色判讀；未圖校，非武英殿底本認證。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p001:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"逸少","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDCA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整所選數位比較傳文與此處角色判讀；未圖校，非武英殿底本認證。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p001:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"導","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整所選數位比較傳文與此處角色判讀；未圖校，非武英殿底本認證。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p001:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"正","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABD","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整所選數位比較傳文與此處角色判讀；未圖校，非武英殿底本認證。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p001:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"曠","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整所選數位比較傳文與此處角色判讀；未圖校，非武英殿底本認證。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p001:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"元帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整所選數位比較傳文與此處角色判讀；未圖校，非武英殿底本認證。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p001:m0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"曠","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整所選數位比較傳文與此處角色判讀；未圖校，非武英殿底本